// .mdix/replacements/replacements.mdix
//
// v23: binary wire version 3, stage 4. Animation channels for fill and
// stroke color, stroke width and dash offset. Requires v22 (already applied).
//
// - msx-ast: AnimatedProperty gains ten style channels, bytes 7 to 16
//   (fill_r/g/b/a, stroke_r/g/b/a, stroke_width, dash_offset) and is_style().
// - msx-binary: a track on one of them calls version::require(3). A scene
//   with only the older channels is still written as version 2.
// - msx-parser: the unknown property error lists the new names. The source
//   names come from the ast tables, so the parser and writer need no more.
// - msx-anim: AnimatedDelta carries the channels and the resolver writes
//   them onto the style of the targeted shape. Groups are left alone.
// - msx-svg-import: animate, animateColor and set of fill, stroke,
//   stroke-width and stroke-dashoffset, and the same CSS keyframe properties,
//   become tracks on the shape itself. Cases with no single plain color
//   target are reported and left static.
// - examples: anim_color_cycle and anim_dash_draw, with their SVG sources.
// - docs: format-spec, animation, binary-format, svg-import, svg-parity and
//   the root README.
//
// The root README.md travels as ROOT_README.md and the override below
// places it. No crate code outside the five crates above changed.

@CONFIG(
  version    -> "1.0.0"
  author     -> "MidManStudio"

  debug_mode -> "off"
)

@QUICKFUNCS(
  ~target<object>(name, path) { return { name = name, path = path } }
)

@DATA(
  target_root = "."

  overrides::
    target("ROOT_Cargo.toml", "./Cargo.toml")
    target("ROOT_README.md", "./README.md")
)
